&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1096&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0cf25a7f0c6e&quot;&gt;Defining and maintaining clear contracts and responsibilities between the teams involved in delivery to reduce cross-team ambiguity and friction&lt;/p&gt;
