&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence and world-class partnerships – all united by our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions). Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Workwize&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Workwize helps companies equip their remote and global teams with IT equipment. Our SaaS platform takes care of buying, delivering, managing and returning laptops and other devices in more than 100 countries. Today more than 50,000 users and 120,000 devices are managed through Workwize.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead the team that builds the systems behind our finance and internal operations. That means billing, invoicing and the internal tools our Operations and Finance teams use every day. The team is small but has a big impact. Mistakes here are expensive, so quality and good judgement matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You lead the engineers, work closely with the team&#39;s Product Manager and report to the Engineering Manager. You also work directly with senior leadership. You own the people, the way the team works and the delivery of the roadmap. You stay close to the code: about 30 to 40% of your time goes to code reviews, technical design and some hands-on work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and grow your engineers through 1:1s, clear feedback and growth plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set a clear bar for performance, and act early when someone is not meeting it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own delivery of the team&#39;s roadmap and keep progress, risks and blockers visible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan the roadmap and quarterly goals with Product, Operations and Finance, including what we say no to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run planning, refinement and retros, and represent the team in talks with other teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep standards high on code review, testing, monitoring, security and incident follow-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire new engineers for your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set good habits for using AI tools in development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years as a software engineer, including at least 1 to 2 years managing engineers with direct reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience handling performance issues: setting expectations, giving hard feedback and supporting someone who is struggling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A leadership style that can switch between directing and coaching, depending on the situation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence to explain and defend your point of view to senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with a modern web stack. We use Laravel (PHP), Node.js, React, Filament and MySQL. You don&#39;t need to know all of them, because strong engineers learn them fast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of delivering B2B web products end to end, working with non-technical colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily use of AI tools in your development work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and spoken English (Dutch is not needed)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in FinTech, or with finance and billing systems (invoicing, order-to-cash, tax, or accounting and ERP integrations like Exact or QuickBooks)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Laravel Filament or other admin panel tools, or moving internal tools off low-code platforms like Retool&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building LLM features or AI agents for internal operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale-up experience, ideally in B2B SaaS, logistics or operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you will work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In the Netherlands: hybrid, 2 to 3 days a week in our Amsterdam office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elsewhere in EMEA: remote, with working hours that overlap with CET and occasional visits to Amsterdam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call with Talent Acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short video interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team fit interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Case study: two short role-play scenarios with the panel. You don&#39;t need to prepare.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible hybrid work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top tools and equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An entrepreneurial culture with room to grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Off-sites and team events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team lunches and surprise events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ClassPass corporate membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Altana is the network for trusted trade. Our AI-powered product network empowers governments and businesses to build a more resilient and secure global economy while keeping trade flowing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity at Altana&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a dedicated Technical Delivery Manager (TDM) who will have the exciting opportunity to collaborate closely with our public sector customers, guiding them in effectively and efficiently operating Altana’s platform. As a TDM, you’ll be the driving force behind user adoption, product enablement, and value realisation, ensuring overall customer success. You’ll be our customers’ champion, serving as their day-to-day relationship manager, conducting regular check-ins, and helping their end users consistently translate product insights into operational value.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Internally, you’ll articulate recurring customer needs and pain points to the business, wrangle cross-functional engineering and product teams to deliver on planned deliverables for your user base, and develop account strategies to strengthen our ongoing partnership with customers. You’ll evolve into a power use of Altana’s products and will use this knowledge to stimulate growth of product usage, up-selling, and cross-selling expansions. You will own the success of our customer deployments, focusing heavily on value creation and customer outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage successful customer deployments and technical work streams from end-to-end, with the ability to effectively manage priorities, deliver on-time, and communicate effectively internally and with customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a power-user of the Atlas platform, then support Public Sector customers in rapidly achieving value, while identifying new use cases to address customer pain points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own customer relationships including conducting Quarterly Business Reviews and leveraging data-driven insights to astonish our clients while promptly relaying valuable feedback to the appropriate Altana teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to user support queries and build processes that enable us to scale our TAM functions as our customer base increases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be held accountable for effectively synthesising and communicating feedback to the product team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the specification of new or expanded features, involving deep collaboration with Altana’s Product &amp;amp; Engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with our Implementation Engineering team to ensure successful delivery and work closely with our Sales Engineering team to identify and prioritise growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Account Executives to identify and capitalise on expansion opportunities, transforming them into reality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance strategic thinking with tactical execution, connecting day-to-day account management with broader commercial and product goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow to become an expert in how governments and enterprises can leverage technology to address supply chain risk, trade enforcement and trade facilitation use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 4-6 years of customer management, technology consulting, or general technology delivery experience, ideally some that involves working with government stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are just as comfortable working with software engineers and data scientists as you are with non-technical customer stakeholders, and have previous experience of translating complex data or technology concepts to new audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can demonstrate a history of successfully expanding technical accounts year over year or leading complex software projects and programmes to successful outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your ability to establish positive relationships and influence others is a key asset, complemented by excellent communication and interpersonal skills, balancing approachability with persistence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re open to feedback and thrive on cross-functional collaboration to drive continuous improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You exhibit good judgement and a willingness to dive into the nitty-gritty to achieve team objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are eligible and willing to obtain a UK Security Check (SC) clearance or have an active clearance already.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An active UK Security Check (SC) clearance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with public sector customers in the UK and overseas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the supply chain or logistics industry is a plus, although not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience conducting self-directed data analysis to answer questions, ideally using SQL or similar languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in London with hybrid work flexibility and candidates must be within commuting distance from our Holborn office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The recruiter assigned to this role can share more information about the specific compensation and benefit details associated with this role during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our values are the core beliefs that shape who we are, what we stand for, and how we behave.They form the foundation of Altana’s culture and integrity and guide how we hire, design, build, and connect with each other and our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trust:&lt;/strong&gt; Our customers and partners entrust us with missions of the highest importance. We honor that by keeping our word, meeting commitments, and ensuring every action we take reinforces confidence in us. We rely on each other to deliver, to speak openly, and to hold ourselves accountable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resilience: &lt;/strong&gt;In a world of uncertainty and complexity, our work must withstand challenges, evolve with conditions, and ensure reliability over time. Resilience is both how we operate and what we deliver. It’s how we respond when things don’t go to plan –– we adapt, we support each other, and we keep moving forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stewardship:&lt;/strong&gt; We are stewards of every mission we touch. Because our work impacts lives and futures, we hold ourselves accountable to delivering mission impact and never compromising. Our responsibility extends beyond individual projects to the broader system of global trade. We believe that stewardship starts from within so that we can bring focus, creativity, and excellence to our work. Each of us is personally responsible for fostering a workplace where people can thrive. And we are stewards of the greater good of the company. By holding ourselves and each other accountable, we build a culture of innovation and collective success that reflects the scale of our mission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Courage: &lt;/strong&gt;Courage is what unlocks the seemingly impossible for our customers. It’s the core value that drives us make bold moves and take on big, complicated network problems—the ones others avoid. We know success isn&#39;t guaranteed, but we have the audacious vision to believe a solution is possible and to build it. Courage fuels our growth mindset. It means embracing challenges that make us stronger, and it’s demonstrated by how we approach hard conversations and complex projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Altana, we believe that a diverse workforce enables greater creativity, performance, and adaptability. We’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer and welcome you to join us as you are. Our employment opportunities and decisions are based on business needs and individual qualifications, without regard to race, color, religious creed, national origin, ancestry, age, physical or mental disability, medical condition, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, family care or medical leave status, military or veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by the laws or regulations in the areas in which we operate. We prohibit discrimination and harassment of any type, in any situation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Offers related to employment at Altana will come from an Altana.ai email address. We will never ask for payment as part of the interview or onboarding process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Flexport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Flexport, we believe global trade can move the human race forward. That’s why it’s our mission to make global commerce so easy there will be more of it. We’re shaping the future of a $10T industry with solutions powered by innovative technology and exceptional people. Today, companies of all sizes—from emerging brands to Fortune 500s—use Flexport technology to move more than $19B of merchandise across 112 countries a year.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The recent global supply chain crisis has put Flexport center stage as we continue to play a pivotal role in how goods move around the world. We are proud to have the support of the best investors in the game who believe in our mission, solutions and people. Ready to tackle global challenges that impact business, society, and the environment? Come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Staff Software Engineer: Applied AI&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every day, thousands of shipments cross borders, change hands, and hit unexpected problems. For decades, fixing those problems meant phone calls, emails, and humans heroically firefighting. We think that&#39;s about to change completely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;ve been building AI agents that spot trouble before it happens, reroute shipments, and keep goods moving—with our team of experts in the loop where it counts. The early results have been jaw-dropping. We&#39;re now going all in on a future where supply chains run themselves, and we&#39;re looking for the people who want to build that future with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a role where you join a team and pick up tickets. You&#39;ll find the highest-leverage problems, design the solutions, and ship them to operators moving freight across 112 countries. If that sounds like your idea of a good time, read on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll build the cutting-edge agents and AI-powered applications that make Flexport&#39;s operations smarter, faster, and increasingly autonomous. That means:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and shipping &lt;strong&gt;end-to-end AI agents&lt;/strong&gt; that handle real logistics work—customs compliance, document processing, exception management, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Crossing organizational boundaries&lt;/strong&gt; to understand problems deeply, align stakeholders, and get things done without waiting for permission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Moving fast from idea to production, treating every deployment as a learning opportunity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working directly with operators, domain experts, and leadership to turn ambiguous problems into shipped solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You Should Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10+ years of software engineering experience&lt;/strong&gt;; you&#39;ve built with LLMs extensively — whether in production, side projects, or just because you couldn&#39;t stop yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong product instincts&lt;/strong&gt;: you can identify what&#39;s worth building, not just execute on a spec&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LLM fluency&lt;/strong&gt;: agent patterns, RAG, prompt engineering, tool use, evaluation. You know what works in production and what looks good in demos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-stack capability&lt;/strong&gt; in TypeScript and Next.js—you can own a feature end to end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An entrepreneurial drive&lt;/strong&gt;: you thrive in ambiguity, move fast, and don&#39;t wait to be told what to do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent communication&lt;/strong&gt;: you can work across teams and disciplines to get alignment and unblock yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An audacious appetite for impact&lt;/strong&gt;: you&#39;re not here to maintain—you&#39;re here to change how global trade works&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with workflow orchestration (Temporal, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building internal tools or operator-facing applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How We Work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We come to the office 3 times a week to hang out, whiteboard, and ship together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have the latest hardware and software—including frontier AI models on day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We&#39;re agile, but not dogmatic. Teams decide how they work best&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stack&lt;/strong&gt;: Next.js, TypeScript, Postgres, Snowflake. For AI: Anthropic, OpenAI, Google AI APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why This Role Is Special&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your work is visible&lt;/strong&gt;: This is a small, senior team reporting directly to the VP of Engineering. What you build gets noticed, and your ideas shape the direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real stakes&lt;/strong&gt;: thousands of containers, 112 countries, $19 billion of goods. Your agents will have immediate, measurable impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: from problem definition to production deployment, it&#39;s yours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re early&lt;/strong&gt;: the playbook for applied AI in enterprise logistics doesn&#39;t exist yet—you&#39;ll help write it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An opportunity to contribute to one of the fastest-growing companies, where you’ll have the chance to create a global impact while being a part of a&amp;nbsp; thriving multinational environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily catered lunches incl. vegetarian options, breakfast, snacks and soft drinks available in our office on daily basis&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commute expenses: Flexport will cover&amp;nbsp; home-office commuting costs for employees living outside of Amsterdam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 working days as vacation days based on full time employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance: Flexport offers a collective health insurance plan including a basic package and any available additional packages. Your monthly premium is fully paid by Flexport.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A defined pension contribution scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity program: every team member becomes a shareholder, aligning our success with yours. As a private company in a multi-trillion dollar industry, you have a direct stake in our collective growth and success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program through Aetna Resources for Living: Flexport provides an employer-sponsored program at no cost to you and your household members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave benefit: Flexport is here to support you and your families in one of the most important times in life – the birth of a child! Our parental leave program allows both mothers and partners to take time off from work for pregnancy, childbirth, and to bond with your new child.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;1704749847.557549&quot; class=&quot;c-virtual_list__item&quot; data-qa=&quot;virtual-list-item&quot; data-item-key=&quot;1704749847.557549&quot;&gt;
